UP":{"CONTENT":"I, whose name and data are indicated above, and in my capacity as the owner of the submitted loan application, acknowledge and undertake the following \u003cbr /\u003e The validity of the data and information provided and enter by me in the real estate advisor screen, and that all recommendations submitted by the system are indicative based on the information available at the portal. \u003cbr /\u003e I have viewed through the electronic portal the mechanism, procedures, policies, and instructions approved and currently in force in the subsidized mortgage program, in partnership with banks and financing companies, and I agree to that. \u003cbr /\u003e This acknowledgment is my approval to issue the loan application number, and accordingly, I am ready to complete the procedures for receiving financing from participating banks or financing companies, obtaining housing support on one of the products available in the sakani program, and benefiting from the approval within two year from the date of its issuance. \u003cbr /\u003e Enabling the Real Estate Development Fund and the Ministry of Municipal and Rural Affairs and Housing to review the Saudi Credit Bureau (SIMAH) in order to inquire about the credit status of the beneficiary. \u003cbr /\u003e Enabling the Fund and the Ministry of Municipal and Rural Affairs and Housing to inquire about my data from the various authorities, according to the policy and regulations of the National Data Management Office.","TITLE":"Acknowledgment of the validity of the information"},"POPUP_AFTER_LOGIN":{"BANNER_LINK":"https://picsum.photos/200/300","CONFIRM_BUTTON":"Read More","CONTENT":"We have a new policy regarding subsidies that we would like to bring your attention. By clicking 'Read More', you agree to the new terms and conditions of the policy. If you do not wish to accept the new policy, please click 'Cancel' to continue with your existing subsidy settings. Please note that this message will only appear once at 